      "Set Battery voltage to 6 V, then back to 12 V, with the resistor unchanged. Ohm’s law predicts that doubling the voltage doubles the current, so compare the two Lamp current readings.",
      "Switch Connection to Parallel. Predict whether the lamp gets brighter or dimmer, then compare Lamp current, Supply current and Lamp power with your series readings.",
